format 1

# Every cache shape src/kind/cache renders (V60-V62): literal and secret
# url and key, a netrc push, cachix with its own token, read-only ones,
# and private ones read with a netrc (src/kind/cache/netrc V66).

## caches
name|kind|url|key|push
example-cache|https|https://cache.example.org|example-cache-1:79mE5RnWzUnV7Xlzq0cdEHe4GW4t0qBGsmoGOUr64p0=|secret:EXAMPLE_NETRC
hidden-cache|https|secret:HIDDEN_URL|secret:HIDDEN_KEY|secret:HIDDEN_NETRC
half-cache|https|https://half.example.org|secret:HALF_KEY|-
read-cache|https|https://read.example.org|read-cache-1:79mE5RnWzUnV7Xlzq0cdEHe4GW4t0qBGsmoGOUr64p0=|-
own-cachix|cachix|-|own-cachix.cachix.org-1:79mE5RnWzUnV7Xlzq0cdEHe4GW4t0qBGsmoGOUr64p0=|secret:OWN_CACHIX_TOKEN
read-cachix|cachix|-|read-cachix.cachix.org-1:79mE5RnWzUnV7Xlzq0cdEHe4GW4t0qBGsmoGOUr64p0=|-
private-cache|https|https://private.example.org|private-cache-1:79mE5RnWzUnV7Xlzq0cdEHe4GW4t0qBGsmoGOUr64p0=|read=secret:PRIVATE_READ, push=secret:PRIVATE_PUSH
private-read|https|secret:PRIVATE_URL|private-read-1:79mE5RnWzUnV7Xlzq0cdEHe4GW4t0qBGsmoGOUr64p0=|read=secret:PRIVATE_READ
